<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, ni gbogbo igbesi aye ati ikojọpọ, imọ-ẹrọ n lọ si ipele ti oṣu mẹfa nipasẹ ọna asopọ aifọwọyi kan.

2
00:00:09.182 --> 00:00:19.087
<v Narrator>Ọkanla, AI ti ọjọ yii n pọ si ni igbesẹ kẹta, lilo ohun elo, nitori awọn iṣẹ rutini ṣe awakọ awọn awoṣe nla lati ibẹrẹ.

3
00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:26.890
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ọrọ miiran, a le sọ pe igbimọ ti o ni agbara to gaju jẹ igbimọ ti o ni agbara giga.
